    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[2].displayTexts.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[3].displayTexts.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[4].displayTexts.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[5].displayTexts.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[6].displayTexts.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'Your growl and a few choice words are directed at the man with the
        white, wispy beard on your right. He grumbles a bit, but you can''t tell
        whether it''s from your words or from his already stupored state. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[1]
      value: 'Your growl and a few choice words are directed at the man with the
        white, wispy beard on your right. He grumbles a bit, but you can''t tell
        whether it''s from your words or from his already stupored state. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[1].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: A whimper escapes your mouth and echoes to the man with the wispy white
        beard on your right. He grumbles a bit, but you can't tell whether it's from
        your sobs or from his already stupored state. However, he flashes a softening
        glance in your direction. "Be strong. Or it will eat you alive."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[2].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: A scream escapes your mouth and echoes to the man with the wispy, white
        beard on your right. He grumbles a bit, but you can't tell whether it's from
        your fearful scream or from his already stupored state. However, he flashes
        a disappointing glance in your direction. "Don't cry. You failed too many
        times already."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[3].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'You let out an elated cheer towards the old man with the wispy, white
        beard on your right. he grumbles a bit, but you can''t tell whether it''s
        from your cheer or from his already stupored state. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[4].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'You extend a welcoming hand to the man with the wispy, white beard
        on your right. He looks at you dazedly. He spats at your hand, leaving a
        brownish gunk. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[5].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'The naked man on the right wall has a wispy, white beard. His skin
        is thickened and gaunt, pressed so tightly that it shows the clear contours
        of his ribs. He mutters to himself. You can see the deep scars strewn all
        over his body. He coughs so hoarsely that you know some infection is growing
        in his lungs. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 149062822422849820, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[6].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'You seek any valuables on the old man ahead of you. You don''t see
        anything worth taking. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4913704698866191632, guid: 01c07700697e5404eb03cefee0f5b367, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
