      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: You look to the ceiling and see text with perfectly straight lines and
        evenly spaced. The text looks so impeccable that you don't feel any sense
        of comfort from knowing there is some sort of intelligent life present. The
        writing looks devoid of empathy. "Failed trial. Clone {roundnumber477}."
