      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4517803644221680943, guid: 31f9b1a2b3dc1074ba162aac78010875, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[4].displayTexts.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4517803644221680943, guid: 31f9b1a2b3dc1074ba162aac78010875, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'You stare at the broken glass chamber behind you. A smile appears on
        your face. "This has given me so many chances to better myself. Increase
        my value, my utility. I hope this time, I produce enough value for them."
        The voice in your head says. You have no definitive idea of the message behind
        it, but still you feel compelled to recite a prayer of gratefulness to it. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4517803644221680943, guid: 31f9b1a2b3dc1074ba162aac78010875, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[1].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'You put a hand on the surface of the glass chamber. So many happy feelings
        from this simple contraption. "This gave me life, over and over." '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4517803644221680943, guid: 31f9b1a2b3dc1074ba162aac78010875, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[2].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: You put a hand on the surface of the glass chamber behind you. So many
        sad feelings from this simple contraction. "I've lost so much with this."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4517803644221680943, guid: 31f9b1a2b3dc1074ba162aac78010875, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[3].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: You put a hand on the surface of the glass chamber behind you. So many
        sad feelings from this simple contraction. "I've lost so much with this."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4517803644221680943, guid: 31f9b1a2b3dc1074ba162aac78010875, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[4].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: Faint memories of past lives floated through your mind. Memories of
        anger. Of wanting to keep your humanity. Not reduced to a number. You swing
        your arm violently against this chamber.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
